type: software
title: "Explainable Weights: an AI agent writes every weight of a transformer"
abstract: "An AI agent writes every weight of a small transformer as readable code, with no training, and explainability tests check that each network can be read: switch-off predictions, a rebuild from the agent's own description, and exhaustive checks."
